  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For the train, moving along the curved rails, it can be written, with reference to the figure below, that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/cb942881-56e1-4c2b-942d-dc10c4940b14.png\" style=\"width: 322px; height: 112px;\"/></p><p>Also, from the above figure, it follows that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Equations (1) and (2) imply that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mi>g</mi></mstyle></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle><mrow><mn>400</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>054</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo> </mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p>",
